  "answer": "Based on my research:\n\n1. **2021 Toyota Aqua battery chemistry**: Bipolar nickel-metal hydride (NiMH) — confirmed by multiple sources as a world-first for road vehicles.\n\n2. **2020 Toyota SUV with highest MSRP using NiMH**: 2020 Toyota Highlander Hybrid (Platinum trim MSRP $51,725). The Highlander Hybrid uses a NiMH battery pack (non-plug-in hybrid), confirmed by OEM parts listings showing \"Battery assy, ni-mh, without plug-in\" for 2020 Highlander Hybrid.\n\n3. **Oil filter cap assembly part number for 2020 Highlander Hybrid**: **15620-36020** (plastic OEM version, per Toyota parts catalogs listing fitment for \"2020 Highlander Hybrid 3.5L\"). There's also an aluminum variant **15620-31060**, but 15620-36020 is the standard assembly shown for this application.\n\n**Answer: 15620-36020**",
